*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.moc3 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pak binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.wav binary
